// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P624615593" "A bunch of Freakshow are running riot in a Crey-owned accounting office. I guess Crey's own security forces must be spread pretty thin, because they haven't been able to respond. Those Freaks will rip that place apart unless someone stops them. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Do you think you can stop that Freakshow raid?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3989899671" "Stop the Freakshow raid"
// SendOffString :
"P2449727836" "The raid leader is a metal Freak named Mass Def. I'd like you to take him out if you can."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P140604343" "Defeat Mass Def and his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P13549097" "I want to know that those Crey accountants are safe!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P806369232" "Panicked people, broken bottles, and crude laughter all point to the presence of the Freakshow."

