// Dialog :
"P4271502939" "You make saving the day look easy, {HeroName}. But what I can't figure out is why the Freaks were there in the first place. From the sound of things, they specifically targeted Mrs. Kellerman. In fact, it sounds like they were hired to go after her! I'm going to see if I can find out a bit more about what they were up to."
// RandomFameString :
"P1586164183" "I hear that {HeroName} saved a Crey office from the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Crey_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1398797766" "I did some checking after the Freakshow hit that Crey office. I still don't know why they were deliberately targeting Mrs. Kellerman, but I did find out that Mass Def, the leader of that raid, often works for a tank Freak called 'Saiba the Damaga.' If the Freakshow had any motivation to attack Crey accountants, then Saiba should know about it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get some answers from Saiba the Damaga.</A> Just don't expect it to be easy."
// AcceptString :
"P4190367247" "Get some answers from Saiba the Damaga"
// SendOffString :
"P1363091955" "Saiba is sure to be well protected, so be careful, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2438769798" "Arrest Saiba and his cronies"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P510784000" "Don't underestimate Saiba the Damaga. He's reputed to be quite dangerous."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3825841882" "The vivid Freakshow graffiti only underscores the drabness of the peeling wallpaper."

