"P1044122474" "We gonna drops some pain on ya!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3255331494" "After you defeated him, Saiba told you about the attack on Kimberly Kellerman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4015214348" "According to Saiba, the Freaks were paid to get Mrs. Kellerman. I wonder who would want a young newlywed accountant dead? Or, more to the point, who'd want her dead badly enough to sic the Freakshow on her entire office? Saiba mentioned that he was supposed to be paid the rest of the money shortly. I'll see if I can find out where that meeting is supposed to take place."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Crey_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2130239707" "According to Saiba the Damaga, the Freaks are supposed to be paid today by the person who hired them to kill Mrs. Kellerman. I don't know if that person will show; after all, you saved Mrs. Kellerman, so the Freaks didn't exactly fulfill their end of the bargain. But you should probably show up at the meeting anyway. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>See if you can find out why the Freaks were hired to kill Mrs. Kellerman.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1787686510" "See if you can find out why the Freaks were hired to kill Mrs. Kellerman"
// SendOffString :
"P3865460250" "I don't know what you're going to be up against in there, so be careful."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2212251886" "Seek clues at Freaks' meeting"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P753224461" "We're still at square one, {HeroName}. I want to know why the Freaks were hired to murder an innocent accountant!"

