// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Crey_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1816470216" "I just spoke with Kimberly Kellerman's sister, Tracy Templeton. She says that Kimberly went to see her husband Ken at work, and now she's disappeared. Considering the Freaks' recent attempt on Mrs. Kellerman's life, as well as Crey's probable involvement, I'm pretty concerned. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you go find Mrs. Kellerman?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1559161872" "Find Mrs. Kellerman"
// SendOffString :
"P81224663" "Mr. Kellerman works as a research scientist at a Crey lab in Steel Canyon. I'd question him first, if I were you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2195142982" "Talk to Ken Kellerman"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3130959012" "Talking to Ken is the first step toward finding his wife."

