// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1660788224" "Ken Kellerman didn't even remember his wife? Either Kimberly Kellerman and her sister are completely bonkers, or something has happened to disrupt Ken's memory. Time for me to do some more digging.<br><br>Crey sent you a public thank you, by the way. According to them, the Crey operatives you fought had gone rogue; they were raiding the lab to sell its contents on the black market. It's more than a little suspicious, but there's not much anyone can do to disprove it. For now."
// RandomFameString :
"P2938763869" "{HeroName} really seems to be cleaning out all the bad eggs at Crey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Crey_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P29818641" "I just got a call from Tracy Templeton, Kimberly Kellerman's sister. She's scared. Really scared. But before she could tell me why, she said she saw several white vans pull up outside her house. Then her phone went dead. I don't think those vans were from her phone company. Tracy's in bad trouble, I'm afraid. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you rescue her, {HeroName}?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1433734920" "Rescue Tracy Templeton"
// SendOffString :
"P491140227" "Tracy got one last call out on her cell phone. I had Paragon Wireless trace the call; apparently it originated in a cave complex."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4154978661" "Tracy sounded pretty scared, {HeroName}. You've got to get her out of there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1031054983" "The cave walls are moist, and your breath is visible in the chilly air."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2714531084" "I just found a cell phone on the girl. We need to double our guard."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2929249497" "Do you think she called {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P628964500" "Once the girl's gone, there won't be any evidence."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2490267275" "Dr. Giacomo think he can indoctrinate the wife, too."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3863656473" "What? Heroes! They'll blow the whole thing!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3136773308" "Tracy Templeton"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3777776593" "I was so scared before you arrived! You saved my life!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P863951705" "You have rescued Tracy Templeton."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P542315024" "The police will be keeping Tracy Templeton in protective custody for now, but I'm afraid she'll have a hard time getting back to her normal life. I checked her story, and it's all true! Her birth certificate doesn't exist in any database. She has no credit history, no property lease, no nothing! The same thing happened to all public records of Tracy's sister, Kimberly Kellerman. It's like someone has tried to erase them from the face of the planet! If we don't find Kimberly soon, I'm afraid we never will!<br><br>Crey has again thanked you for rooting out corruption within their company. Their story is starting to sound pretty thin to me, though."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Crey_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P199166900" "I just got a call from Ken Kellerman. He says that he remembers everything. I'm glad to hear his memory's back, but I'm afraid it may have caused him some trouble. Apparently he started asking the wrong people what happened to his wife, and now he thinks that Crey security is after him. He's hiding now in an old office building, trying to avoid what he called the 'Mind Sweepers.' <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you extract him?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2738381335" "Extract Ken Kellerman"
// SendOffString :
"P3327224873" "Curiouser and curiouser. {HeroName}, I hope you can discover something that will help us get to the bottom of this."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3792563308" "Defeat security chief, his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2838817936" "I'm counting on you to get Ken Kellerman to safety."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3705729432" "It looks like Ken had to break a window to get inside this old building. You hope Crey security hasn't noticed that little clue."

