// Dialog :
"P3817177847" "You have rescued both Ken and Kimberly Kellerman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1960755567" "I wonder how many of Crey's employees have undergone mind control or memory erasure, like poor Ken Kellerman. At least he's reunited with his wife now, and safe in protective custody. They send along their thanks. Ken's ready to come forward with everything he can about this Crey mind control process. As soon as I've heard his statement, I'll get back to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_Crey_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P50026277" "The Kellermans have been through a lot at Crey's hands, {HeroName}: kidnapping, manipulation, attempted murder. Ken Kellerman's memory was even temporarily altered, for crying out loud! Nevertheless, he's willing to come forward with everything he knows about Crey's mind control techniques. He even told us where we can find the Crey Mind Control Center. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>It's time to take it out.</A> Are you ready?"
// AcceptString :
"P1821357286" "Take out the Crey Mind Control Center"
// SendOffString :
"P1238179551" "Good. The Mind Control Center is in Talos Island, under the direction of a Dr. Giacomo. I want that man behind bars, {HeroName}. I know you can get the job done."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P723930676" "Stop Giacomo, his assistants"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P215217777" "That Crey Mind Control Center has to be shut down before Dr. Giacomo can ruin any more lives!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2837632649" "The lab's defenses aren't enough to even slow your stride. After all, this is a battle for the sanctity of human hearts and minds."

